Third-party components bundled in this repository
=================================================

This repository is a derivative of the Initial Plus Typecho theme, and it
carries several third-party components inside it. Each keeps its own licence.
The MIT LICENSE at the root covers NYY's own modifications to the theme — it
does not relicense the components listed here.

Where a component states its licence in its own file header, that is quoted
below. Where it does not, the licence is noted as "not stated in the bundled
file" — check the upstream project before relying on it.


