Loaded at runtime from a CDN (not bundled here)
-----------------------------------------------
initial_plus/header.php pulls Tabler Icons from jsDelivr, pinned to @latest:

    https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/...

Two things worth knowing: an unpinned @latest can change under you without
warning, and it means a page load reaches out to a third party — which leaks
visitor IPs to that CDN and will fail on an air-gapped install. Consider
vendoring the font instead.

The theme also calls out to these services at runtime:
  wttr.in            weather in the navbar
  myip.ipip.net      IP geolocation for the weather background
  cravatar.cn /      avatar sources (only Cravatar is still working upstream)
  gravatar.com
  sinaimg.cn         random background images (lib/bz.txt, lib/dm.txt)


